    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Some of the above pieces can\nbe considered as \"process art\", in that their creation\nwas a direct result of the viscosity properties of the\nactual material. Other pieces (Graubner, Rentmeister\n'94, Kapoor) allude to such processes in an essentially\nmimetic fashion.",
      "links": []
    },
